# Build output
/build/
/out/
/release/
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.ilk

# Vendored loader binaries are committed under vendor/ (release source of truth).
# Build dependencies fetched at configure time stay out of git.

# Editor / IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Tooling
.pixi/
.claude/
.lab/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.mcp.json

# Launcher install state
.headtracking-state.json

# NexusMods page copy source (not shipped)
NEXUS_MODS.md

# Reverse-engineering scratch. RE work lives OUTSIDE this repo, under
# C:\Data\re-workspace\mirrors-edge-headtracking\. A Ghidra project embeds the
# full game image, and a decompiled listing is a derivative of it, so neither
# may sit in the working tree where one `git add -f` would publish it.
/re/
*.gpr
*.rep
*.lock
!pixi.lock

# Game-owned binaries and assets. We redistribute no part of the game; these
# patterns make an accidental commit impossible rather than merely unlikely.
*.exe
*.bik
*.upk
*.sfx
*.tfc
